{"5456010":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Alley Workshop","steam_appid":5456010,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alley Workshop is a cozy, single-player crafting puzzle game set in a small workshop tucked away in a quiet alley.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each order is a puzzle. Fit supplied parts into a blueprint, rotate them when needed, and cut new materials to fill the remaining spaces. Keep an eye on material costs, then deliver the finished object to your neighbor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the campaign progresses, piece together fragmented blueprints and take on separate front, side, and top views. Each new order adds another challenge to your days at the workbench.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the workshop, discover the lives of the people you help. Their handwritten letters and illustrations reveal what the everyday objects you make mean to them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Crafting puzzles about fitting existing parts and filling gaps with new materials.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Blueprint assembly puzzles and separate front, side, and top views.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Twelve in-game workshop days followed by a letter-filled epilogue.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Neighbor stories told through visits and illustrated letters.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alley Workshop is a cozy, single-player crafting puzzle game set in a small workshop tucked away in a quiet alley.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each order is a puzzle. Fit supplied parts into a blueprint, rotate them when needed, and cut new materials to fill the remaining spaces. Keep an eye on material costs, then deliver the finished object to your neighbor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the campaign progresses, piece together fragmented blueprints and take on separate front, side, and top views. Each new order adds another challenge to your days at the workbench.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the workshop, discover the lives of the people you help. Their handwritten letters and illustrations reveal what the everyday objects you make mean to them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Crafting puzzles about fitting existing parts and filling gaps with new materials.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Blueprint assembly puzzles and separate front, side, and top views.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Twelve in-game workshop days followed by a letter-filled epilogue.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Neighbor stories told through visits and illustrated letters.<\/p>","short_description":"A cozy crafting puzzle game set in a quiet alley workshop. Fit parts, cut new materials, and piece together fragmented blueprints. Complete everyday objects for your neighbors and discover their stories through handwritten letters.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5456010\/57f7422d3ef726226bba88e05c98a9b4e0bfc7de\/header.jpg?t=1793646188","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5456010\/d2f89c8b2a9a3a672c8fa34f24239166e4c0b209\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793646188","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5456010\/d2f89c8b2a9a3a672c8fa34f24239166e4c0b209\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793646188","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 64-bit dual-core processor with SSE4.2 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><str